<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cheesecake Factory begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cheesecake Factory begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said on Friday it started coverage on the shares of Cheesecake Factory Inc with a strong buy rating and a $30 per share price target.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Allan Hickok said in a research note the bakery business may have finally turned the corner after its slow earnings growth the past two years.</p>
<p>-- Hickok said he expected positive earnings leverage from bakery sales gains, which could generate earnings upside.</p>
<p>-- The stock added 7/8 to 25.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
